---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Floating elements — legacy</h1>
    <p>
      The historical <code>floating-element</code> class is not shipped by the stable package
      entries. Prefer semantic <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> markup plus normal application CSS, or use
      Markup Refine's Grid/Cluster layout primitives for composition.
    </p>
    <p>
      See <a href="../../usage/layout/">Layout primitives</a> and
      <a href="../figures/">Figures</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
